{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations-of-the-information-age","title":"信息时代的双重奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-computing/foundations-of-the-information-age","wordCount":1671,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"信息时代的双重奠基\">信息时代的双重奠基</h1><p>1948 年前后的贝尔实验室数学楼里，发生了一件后来被反复提起的巧合：克劳德·香农（Claude Shannon）正在写他的《通信的数学理论》，而与他共用一间办公室的汉明，正在琢磨怎么让计算机自己纠正出错的比特。汉明本人对此的评价是带着调侃的清醒——「两个人在同一个地方、同一个时间做出了这件事，这有点可疑，它就在空气里。」香农回答的是「信息最多能可靠传输多快」（理论极限），汉明回答的是「怎么真的把它可靠传过去」（构造方法）。这两个问题合在一起，构成了信息时代的理论地基。</p>\n<p>本篇要说明的，正是这种「双重奠基」：汉明的贡献不是孤立的技术发明，而是与香农的信息论互为表里、共同把通信从经验工艺变成精确科学的那一半。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解汉明的奠基地位，关键是看清他与香农各自回答了什么、又如何拼成一个整体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[贝尔实验室 1940年代末&lt;br/&gt;可靠通信难题] --&gt; B[香农: 信息论&lt;br/&gt;可靠传输的极限是多少]&#10;    A --&gt; C[汉明: 编码理论&lt;br/&gt;如何构造纠错的码字]&#10;    B --&gt; D[信道容量&lt;br/&gt;存在性证明]&#10;    C --&gt; E[汉明码 7,4&lt;br/&gt;显式构造]&#10;    D --&gt; F[现代信息科学&lt;br/&gt;理论与工程的合流]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[通信 / 存储 / 计算&lt;br/&gt;的可靠性基础]\">flowchart TD\n    A[贝尔实验室 1940年代末&lt;br/&gt;可靠通信难题] --&gt; B[香农: 信息论&lt;br/&gt;可靠传输的极限是多少]\n    A --&gt; C[汉明: 编码理论&lt;br/&gt;如何构造纠错的码字]\n    B --&gt; D[信道容量&lt;br/&gt;存在性证明]\n    C --&gt; E[汉明码 7,4&lt;br/&gt;显式构造]\n    D --&gt; F[现代信息科学&lt;br/&gt;理论与工程的合流]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[通信 / 存储 / 计算&lt;br/&gt;的可靠性基础]</pre><p>香农证明了「在噪声信道上存在可逼近容量的好码」，但他的证明是存在性的，没有告诉人们那个码长什么样；汉明则给出了第一个人能真正写下来、算得出、造得进电路的纠错码。理论与构造的这种分工与互补，是下面这张对照表的核心。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>香农的信息论</th>\n<th>汉明的编码理论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心问题</td>\n<td>可靠传输的极限速率</td>\n<td>如何构造可纠错的编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键成果</td>\n<td>信道容量、熵</td>\n<td>汉明码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[7,4]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、汉明距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证明性质</td>\n<td>存在性（好码必存在）</td>\n<td>构造性（给出具体码）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标志年份</td>\n<td>1948</td>\n<td>1950</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>留给后人的</td>\n<td>「能做到多好」的标尺</td>\n<td>「怎么做到」的第一块样板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从一句牢骚到一篇论文\">从一句牢骚到一篇论文</h2><p>汉明开创纠错码的起点是个非常具体的恼火。1940 年代末，他在周末把计算任务排进贝尔实验室的继电器计算机，机器一旦读到校验错误就停机等人工处理，到周一汉明常常发现一整夜的计算因为一个比特翻转而白费。他的反应不是「重算」，而是追问：机器既然能「发现」错误，为什么不能「定位并改正」错误？</p>\n<p>这个追问的答案就是 1950 年发表在《贝尔系统技术杂志》上的《纠错与检错码》。汉明在其中系统地提出了用多个校验位覆盖数据位、并让校验结果直接「指向」出错位置的思路。关于这套机制的技术细节——校验位如何安排、汉明码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[7,4]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 如何把 4 个数据位编成 7 位码字——属于核心贡献卷的内容，可参见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-code\">汉明码</a>。本篇关心的是它的奠基意义：这是历史上第一个能自动纠正单比特错误的实用编码，把「容错」从「重试」升级成了「数学」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汉明距离-给-相似-一个尺子\">汉明距离：给「相似」一个尺子</h2><p>汉明工作的另一半奠基性，藏在一个看似朴素的定义里：两个等长字符串之间的汉明距离，就是它们对应位不同的个数。对于二进制串，它等于按位异或后 1 的个数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(x, y) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} [x_i \\neq y_i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个定义之所以是「奠基」，是因为它把「纠错能力」变成了可计算的几何量。一个码若任意两个码字的最小汉明距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则它能纠正的错误数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{d_{\\min} - 1}{2} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，只要把合法码字在「汉明空间」里拉得足够开，落在某个码字附近的受损串就能被唯一地拉回正确码字。整个编码理论后来都建立在这种「距离—纠错能力」的对应之上。这条对应关系可以列成一张明白的判据表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>最小距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>可检错位数</th>\n<th>可纠错位数</th>\n<th>典型编码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>奇偶校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>汉明码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[7,4]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1 并报告双错</td>\n<td>SECDED（如 72,64）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可见「纠错能力」不再是经验判断，而是由码字之间的最小距离唯一决定的量——这正是把工程问题「数学化」的关键一步：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先定义距离，把「像不像」变成一个数；</li>\n<li>再由最小距离推出能检几位、纠几位；</li>\n<li>最后由目标纠错能力反推所需的最小距离与校验位数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>汉明距离的展开讨论见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance\">汉明距离</a>；这里要强调的是，它和汉明码一样，是后世几十年编码理论得以生长的根系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与香农并立-而非依附\">与香农并立，而非依附</h2><p>一个常见的误解是把汉明当成「香农信息论的一个应用」。事实更对等：两人是几乎同时、各自独立地从不同方向逼近同一个问题。香农给出了可达性的上界与熵这把标尺，汉明给出了第一个落地的构造与汉明界（Hamming bound，又称球填充界）这一对码字数量的限制。香农说「好码一定存在」，汉明说「这里就有一个，而且我能造进机器」。</p>\n<p>正因如此，两人常被并称为信息时代的共同奠基者，而后世以两人命名的最高荣誉也彼此呼应——香农奖与汉明奖章。关于汉明在贝尔实验室与这群「青年土耳其党人」（Young Turks，香农、汉明等人的自称）共事的具体经历，见生平卷 <a href=\"../../life-and-times/bell-labs-years/joining-bell-labs\">初入贝尔实验室</a>。理解了这种并立关系，才能准确地给汉明定位：他不是某个大理论的注脚，而是地基里独立承重的一根柱子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>汉明的奠基性体现在「构造」一侧：他给出了第一个能自动纠正单比特错误的实用编码，补全了香农「存在性证明」未触及的工程落地。</li>\n<li>汉明距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把抽象的「纠错能力」变成可计算的几何量，最小距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与纠错数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的对应成为整个编码理论的基石。</li>\n<li>汉明与香农在 1948—1950 年间几乎同时、独立地从极限与构造两侧逼近「可靠通信」，二者并立而非依附，共同奠定信息时代的理论地基。</li>\n<li>这一奠基的起点极为务实：一台周末停机的继电器计算机，逼出了「让机器自己改错」的根本追问。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信息时代的双重奠基","id":"信息时代的双重奠基"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从一句牢骚到一篇论文","id":"从一句牢骚到一篇论文"},{"level":2,"text":"汉明距离：给「相似」一个尺子","id":"汉明距离-给-相似-一个尺子"},{"level":2,"text":"与香农并立，而非依附","id":"与香农并立-而非依附"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"纠错技术的无处不在","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-computing/error-correction-everywhere"}}